WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:04.810
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is Not Allowed
To Do At The Foundation: No interacting with

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:09.620
SCP-5555-J under any circumstances!

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:15.929
SCP-5555-J is capable of reducing any living
organism to a miniature (or chibi, if you’d

00:00:15.929 --> 00:00:17.470
prefer) version of itself.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:21.620
Dr. Bright may claim he is trying to make
teacup pigs to hand out at the office as an

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.200
incentive, but do not fall for it!

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:29.870
The last time Dr. Bright was exposed to SCP-5555-J,
the miniature version it produced of him was

00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:31.790
a miniature orangutan.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:35.490
He was brought into custody, and proceeded
to behave quite poorly with some of his own

00:00:35.490 --> 00:00:39.790
bathroom material, and completely destroy
the attending researcher’s clothing, before

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:41.740
escaping to wreak even more havoc.

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:48.480
Dr. Bright knows what mini-him did, and he
has lost his 5555-J privileges for good.

